WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.960
Hands full, and the phone's ringing… again?

2
00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:09.890
Miss the call, and Gripply texts them back for you. Job saved!

3
00:00:10.090 --> 00:00:16.230
Calls, texts, WhatsApp, Instagram and Messenger… all in one thread.

4
00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:19.210
Whatever you agree becomes a to-do.

5
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:21.900
Settle on a time, and it's in the diary.

6
00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:26.270
Then quote it, bill it, and get paid, all from your phone.

7
00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:30.450
And every morning, a brief of who to ring back and what to chase.

8
00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:34.250
Gripply. More jobs… less admin.
